---
title: "07 — Worker Execution (proposed; all MVP; every step audited)"
---
%% Legend: dispatcher = single enforcement chokepoint; model/web content = untrusted data.
%% Req IDs: WORK-001..006, TOOL-001..003, NFR-021, invariants 3/4/6/17.
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Workflow coordinator
  participant W as Worker runtime (tenant context, invariant 3)
  participant D as Tool dispatcher (chokepoint)
  participant P as Policy engine
  participant G as Model gateway
  participant S as Object storage
  participant U as Usage ledger

  C->>W: job (worker_id@version, task input, company_id)
  W->>W: assemble context (memory provenance-ranked,<br/>secret blocklist — invariant 12, MEM-004 precedence)
  loop each tool call in control flow
    W->>D: propose tool call
    D->>D: allowlist check (invariant 4, deny-by-default)
    D->>P: policy evaluate №3 + stop-state + approval verify/consume
    alt denied / stopped / approval invalid
      D-->>W: fail closed + audited
    else authorized
      D->>G: model call (schema-validated, redacted logging)
      G-->>D: validated output | normalized error
      Note over G: external content returned is DATA —<br/>instructions inside it are inert (invariant 17)
      D->>U: usage event (company + account)
    end
  end
  W->>S: persist artifact (tenant-prefixed path)
  alt persist fails
    W->>C: task FAILED (no hollow success — TASK-005)
  else persisted
    W->>C: completed + artifact refs + provenance
  end
